{"version":1,"slug":"Oliiveboardd__Reasoning_Super_Prac__Reasoning_Mock_015_-_Syllogism","path":"Oliiveboardd/Reasoning Super Prac/Reasoning Mock 015 - Syllogism.html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Oliiveboardd","category":"Reasoning Super Prac","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":10,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<div class=\"status-sec\"><table class=\"table-status\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"noborder\"></td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Time</td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Status</td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">You</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">2 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-unat\">Unattempted</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">Topper</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">57 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-correct\">Correct</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><span class=\"eqt\"><p>In this question, a statement is followed by two conclusions, numbered I and II. Decide which of the two conclusions is/are true based on the given statement.</p><p>Statement: M &lt; N &le; O = S &gt; T &ge; W &ge; Z</p><p>Conclusions:</p><p>I. M &le; T</p><p>II. N &lt; Z</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2340;&#2351; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366;/&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;: M &lt; N &le; O = S &gt; T &ge; W &ge; Z</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;:</p><p>I. M &le; T</p><p>II. N &lt; Z</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only Conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only Conclusion I is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Both Conclusion I and Conclusion II are true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Neither Conclusion I nor Conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>We have the inequality series as:-</p><p>M &lt; N &le; O = S &gt; T &ge; W &ge; Z</p><p>So:-</p><p>I. M &le; T :- It is false because, <b>M</b> &lt; N &le; O = S &gt; <b>T</b></p><p>II. N &lt; Z :- It is false because <b>N</b> &le; O = S &gt; T &ge; W &ge; <b>Z</b></p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<div class=\"status-sec\"><table class=\"table-status\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"noborder\"></td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Time</td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Status</td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">You</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">0 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-unat\">Unattempted</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">Topper</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">12 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-correct\">Correct</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><span class=\"eqt\"><p>A statement is followed by two conclusions, numbered I and II. Find out which of the following conclusion(s) is/are true based on the given statements.</p><p>Statement: P &le; L &ge; M &ge; N = U &lt; V &lt; G</p><p>Conclusions:</p><p>I. P &gt; V</p><p>II. G &le; L</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;: P &le; L &ge; M &ge; N = U &lt; V &lt; G</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;:</p><p>I. P &gt; V</p><p>II. G &le; L</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Both conclusions I and II are true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion I is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Neither conclusion I nor II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Conclusions:</p><p>I. P &gt; V: P &le; L &ge; M &ge; N = U &lt; V --- all signs are not in the same direction, so this is false.</p><p>II. G &le; L: L &ge; M &ge; N = U &lt; V &lt; G --- all signs are not in the same direction, so this is false.</p><p>So, neither conclusion I nor II is true.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<div class=\"status-sec\"><table class=\"table-status\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"noborder\"></td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Time</td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Status</td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">You</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">0 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-unat\">Unattempted</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">Topper</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">14 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-correct\">Correct</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><span class=\"eqt\"><p>A statement is followed by two conclusions, numbered I and II. Find out which of the following conclusion(s) is/are true based on the given statements.</p><p>Statement: T &ge; M &lt; W = P &ge; Q &gt; R &le; S</p><p>Conclusions:</p><p>I. P &le; M</p><p>II. Q &gt; T</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2342;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; II &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2