t-black\">Time</td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Status</td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">You</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">0 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-unat\">Unattempted</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">Topper</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">16 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-correct\">Correct</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><span class=\"eqt\"><p>Read the given statement and conclusions carefully. Decide which of the given conclusions is/are definitely true from the statement.</p><p>Statement: F &gt; B &lt; E &le; C = D &ge; A &gt; G</p><p>Conclusion I: G &lt; F</p><p>Conclusion II: C &gt; G</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2379; &#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2338;&#2364;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2351; &#2354;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366;/&#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;: F &gt; B &lt; E &le; C = D &ge; A &gt; G</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I: G &lt; F</p><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II: C &gt; G</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Both conclusion I and conclusion II are true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion I is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Neither conclusion I nor conclusion II is true</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344; &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; &#2344; &#2361;&#2368; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Conclusion I: G &lt; F: F &gt; B &lt; E &le; C = D &ge; A &gt; G ---- does not follow because all the signs are not in the same direction. </p><p>Conclusion II: C &gt; G: C = D &ge; A &gt; G ---- follows because all the signs are in the same direction. </p><p>So, Only conclusion II is true.</p><p>Thus, option (a) is the correct answer. </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<div class=\"status-sec\"><table class=\"table-status\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"noborder\"></td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Time</td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Status</td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">You</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">0 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-unat\">Unattempted</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">Topper</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">17 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-correct\">Correct</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the following question, the statement is followed by two conclusions. Which of the two conclusions is/are true?</p><p>Statement:</p><p>M&lt;K&