III) I &gt; J</p><p>IV) M &lt; D</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion II is true.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Only conclusion IV is true.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; IV &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Conclusions I and III are true.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; I &#2324;&#2352; III &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Conclusions IV and II are true.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; IV &#2324;&#2352; II &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>I &lt; <b>M &lt; F &le; D &le; S</b> = J; M &lt; S</p><p>I &lt; M &lt; <b>F &le; D &le; S</b> = J; F &le; S</p><p><b>I &lt; M &lt; F &le; D &le; S = J</b>; I &lt; J</p><p>I &lt; <b>M &lt; F &le; D</b> &le; S = J; M &lt; D</p><p>Hence, only conclusion IV is true.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<div class=\"status-sec\"><table class=\"table-status\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"noborder\"></td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Time</td><td class=\"noborder txt-black\">Status</td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">You</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">0 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-unat\">Unattempted</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"txt-black bg-blue\">Topper</td><td class=\"txt-muted\">21 sec</td><td><span class=\"tst-status status-correct\">Correct</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><span class=\"eqt\"><p>In this question, two statements are followed by four conclusions given as options. Decide which conclusion is definitely true, based on the given statements.</p><p>Statements:</p><p>A &lt; B &ge; C &gt; D</p><p>C &gt; E &ge; F = G</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2342;&#2379; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2340;&#2351; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;:</p><p>A &lt; B &ge; C &gt; D</p><p>C &gt; E &ge; F = G</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">G &gt; C</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">G &gt; C</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">D &lt; F</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">D &lt; F</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">A &lt; E</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">A &lt; E</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">B &gt; G</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">B &gt; G</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Option 1: G &gt; C: C &gt; E &ge; F = C. This is definitely false.</p><p>Option 2: D &lt; F: D &lt; C &gt; E &ge; F. This is definitely false</p><p>Option 3: A &lt; E: A &lt; B &ge; C &gt; E. This is definitely false</p><p>Option 4: B &gt; G: B &ge; C &gt; E &ge; F = G. This is definitely true.</p><p>So, option 4 is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}